# Header toolbar

The product title uses **font-weight 600**. Import / Export labels must not look lighter than the title on common displays (e.g. 微軟正黑體 / system UI).

When editing [`Header/index.js`](src/App/Components/Header/index.js) or [`Upload.js`](src/App/Components/Header/Upload.js):

- Keep **`.menu .button`** labels at **`font-weight: 600`** and **`font-size: 15px`** unless there is a deliberate redesign. Do not drop to **400** or **500** for primary action text without retesting with the app font stack.
- Keep **`font-family: inherit`** on the header and buttons so labels use the same stack as `#md2pdf-app` (`App/index.js`).
- If you change the header **vertical size** (`min-height`, button `height`), update [`Markdown/index.js`](src/App/Components/Markdown/index.js) **`height: calc(100% - …px)`** so the subtracted value matches the real header bar height.

The **version** badge (`.project small`) may stay slightly lighter (**`font-weight: 500`**, muted gray); that is intentional contrast with the title and actions.
